idant activity applying an improved ABTS radical cation decolorization assay</article-title><source>Free Radic. Biol. Med.</source><volume>26</volume><fpage>1231</fpage><lpage>1237</lpage><year>1999</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10381194</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zeneli</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsitsimpikou</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Petrakis</surname><given-names>P.V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Naxakis</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Habili</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Roussis</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Foliar and cortex oleoresin variability of silver fir (Abies alba Mill.) in Albania</article-title>. <source>Z. Naturforsch [C]</source><volume>56</volume><fpage>531</fpage><lpage>539</lpage><year>2001</year></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karkabounas</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Assimakopoulos</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Malamas</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Skaltsounis</surname><given-names>A.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Leonce</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Zelovitis</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Stefanou</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Evangelou</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antiproliferative and anticarcinogenic effects of an aqueous preparation of <italic>Abies alba</italic> and <italic>Viscum se abies</italic>, on a L-1210 malignant cell line and tumor-bearing Wistar rat</article-title><source>Anticancer Res.</source><volume>